  },
  "note": "Evidence for the ONDJ rainfall domain. No candidate is selected: the operational ONDJ domain (R3 Deyr) is unchanged. No EMI long-term Bega maps are registered: the Bega 2026/27 Seasonal Climate Forecast had no document when checked (2026-10-10). ONDJ months are summed within each calendar year (January of the same year); the climatological mean is unaffected by the pairing."
